2026-07-27T10:43:03.7580397Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T10:43:03.7641522Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T10:43:03.7642369Z i /tmp/RtmpVsNtrc/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:43:03.7642807Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:43:03.7643321Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:43:03.7643768Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:43:03.7644464Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:43:03.7645788Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:43:03.7646910Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T10:43:03.7885381Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T10:43:03.7992232Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T10:43:03.8404645Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T10:43:03.8551239Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
